# the same calls with folding withheld: none is its answer. Each goes by its row, or by the plain operator that the ranges of its operands leave, which hands nothing on and so needs no folding
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=none+DirectCalls+BuiltinCalls+TypedOperations+UnboxedNumbers
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK: = CallInline {{*}}inlineBuiltin=MathMax
# CHECK: = Negate
# CHECK: = Mul
# CHECK: = CallInline {{*}}inlineBuiltin=MathRound
# CHECK: = NewArray
# RUN(WHOLE): walk f2 mechanisms=none+DirectCalls+BuiltinCalls+TypedOperations+UnboxedNumbers
# WHOLE-LABEL: code f2:Body
# WHOLE-COUNT-3: = Call
# PROGRAM-OF: call-of-a-built-in-on-known-numbers-is-its-answer.ir
